{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Connect — {{BUSINESS_NAME}} • Book or Ask</title>
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#0f1724;--card:#0b1220;--accent:#8ad0c9;--muted:#9aa6b2;--glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);--glass-2:rgba(255,255,255,0.02)}
    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;font-family:Inter,system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial;color:#e6eef1;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 10% 10%, rgba(138,208,201,0.06), transparent 10%), linear-gradient(180deg,#07101a 0%, #071422 60%);} 
    .page{min-height:100%;display:flex;flex-direction:column}
    header{padding:22px 28px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}
    .brand{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center}
    .logo{width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),#356bfc);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#022;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(8,13,18,0.6)}
    .logo svg{width:36px;height:36px}
    nav a{color:#cfeff0;text-decoration:none;margin-left:18px;font-weight:600}
    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:32px;padding:40px 28px}
    .hero-card{background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--glass),transparent);padding:28px;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.02);backdrop-filter:blur(6px)}
    h1{margin:0 0 10px;font-size:28px;letter-spacing:-0.02em}
    p.lead{margin:0 0 18px;color:var(--muted)}
    .contact-panel{padding:18px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--card),#071323);box-shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(3,8,12,0.6)}
    .field{display:flex;flex-direction:column;margin-bottom:12px}
    input,textarea,select{padding:10px 12px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);background:transparent;color:#e6f7f6}
    button.cta{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),#5ed3ff);border:0;padding:12px 16px;border-radius:10px;color:#042;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}

    /* Aroma wheel */
    .wheel-wrap{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:12px}
    .wheel{width:320px;height:320px}
    .note-list{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center}
    .note-pill{padding:8px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--glass-2);color:#bfe6e0;font-size:13px}
    .desc{min-height:56px;color:var(--muted);text-align:center}

    /* Proof gallery */
    .gallery{display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:flex-start}
    .testimonials{flex:1;padding:18px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),transparent)}
    .quote{min-height:84px;font-style:italic;color:#dff6f2}
    .meta{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-top:12px}
    .badges{display:flex;gap:10px}
    .badge{position:relative;padding:8px;border-radius:8px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);cursor:default}
    .tooltip{position:absolute;bottom:calc(100% + 8px);left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);background:#02111a;color:#bfe6e0;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transition:opacity .18s}
    .badge:hover .tooltip{opacity:1}

    /* FAQ / objections */
    .faq{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:14px}
    details{background:var(--glass);padding:12px;border-radius:10px}
    summary{cursor:pointer;font-weight:700}

    footer{padding:28px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.02);display:flex;justify-content:space-between}

    @media(max-width:880px){.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.wheel{width:260px;height:260px}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="page">
    <header>
      <div class="brand">
        <div class="logo" aria-hidden>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" fill="white" opacity="0.06"/><path d="M12 6c1.7 0 3.1.9 4 2.2-1 .9-2.4 1.5-4 1.5s-3-.6-4-1.5C8.9 6.9 10.3 6 12 6z" fill="#021018" opacity="0.9"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div style="font-weight:800;color:#dff6f2">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
          <div style="color:var(--muted);font-size:13px">Gentle, focused aroma intensives</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <nav>
        <a href="index.html">Home</a>
        <a href="services.html">Offerings</a>
        <a href="blends.html">Blends</a>
        <a href="shop.html">Emporium</a>
        <a href="pricing.html">Rates</a>
        <a href="about.html">About</a>
        <a href="book.html">Book</a>
        <a href="contact.html">Connect</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main style="padding:0 28px 40px">
      <section class="hero">
        <div class="hero-card">
          <h1>Ask, request, or arrange an intensive session</h1>
          <p class="lead">Use this page to reach out about private intensives, group consultations, or custom therapeutic blends. We respond within 48 hours. Shared notes below will help us prepare.</p>

          <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:14px">
            <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">Phone</div>
            <div style="font-weight:700">{{PHONE}}</div>
            <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-left:14px">Email</div>
            <div style="font-weight:700">{{EMAIL}}</div>
          </div>

          <div class="contact-panel">
            <form id="contactForm" onsubmit="return handleSubmit(event)">
              <div class="field"><label>Name</label><input type="text" name="name" required placeholder="Your name"></div>
              <div class="field"><label>Email</label><input type="email" name="email" required placeholder="you@domain.com"></div>
              <div class="field"><label>Phone</label><input type="tel" name="phone" placeholder="Optional"></div>
              <div class="field"><label>What are you seeking?</label>
                <select name="interest">
                  <option>Private Aroma Intensive</option>
                  <option>Custom Blend Consultation</option>
                  <option>Group workshop</option>
                  <option>Wholesale / retail inquiry</option>
                </select>
              </div>
              <div class="field"><label>Short note</label><textarea name="message" rows="4" placeholder="Tell us gently what you'd like support with"></textarea></div>
              <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center">
                <button class="cta" type="submit">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</button>
                <div style="color:var(--muted);font-size:13px">Or call <strong>{{PHONE}}</strong></div>
              </div>
            </form>
          </div>
        </div>

        <aside style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px">
          <div class="hero-card wheel-wrap">
            <strong style="letter-spacing:0.02em">Aroma wheel — hover a slice</strong>
            <svg class="wheel" viewBox="0 0 300 300" id="aromaWheel" role="img" aria-label="Interactive aroma wheel">
              <defs>
                <linearGradient id="g1" x1="0" x2="1"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#8ad0c9" stop-opacity="0.9"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#6bb3ff" stop-opacity="0.9"/></linearGradient>
                <filter id="soft"><feGaussianBlur stdDeviation="6"/></filter>
              </defs>
              <circle cx="150" cy="150" r="140" fill="#06151a" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.03)"/>
              <!-- Top notes -->
              <path d="M150 150 L150 10 A140 140 0 0 1 270 90 z" fill="url(#g1)" data-type="Top" data-desc="Bright, fleeting notes — citrus, herb topnotes that introduce the blend. These may support immediate uplift or clarity." opacity="0.95"/>
              <!-- Middle notes -->
              <path d="M150 150 L270 90 A140 140 0 0 1 30 90 z" fill="#3ad1b6" data-type="Middle" data-desc="Heart of the blend — floral and green notes that unfold and linger; they shape the character of the aroma." opacity="0.92"/>
              <!-- Base notes -->
              <path d="M150 150 L30 90 A140 140 0 0 1 150 10 z" fill="#4b7fff" data-type="Base" data-desc="Weighty, grounding notes — resin, wood, musk-like accords that anchor the scent and extend its presence." opacity="0.9"/>
              <circle cx="150" cy="150" r="60" fill="#071a1d"/>
              <text x="50%" y="50%" text-anchor="middle" dy="6" fill="#bfe6e0" font-weight="700" font-size="18">Aroma Wheel</text>
            </svg>
            <div class="desc" id="noteDesc">Hover a slice to read about that group of notes.</div>
            <div class="note-list">
              <div class="note-pill">Citrus</div>
              <div class="note-pill">Floral</div>
              <div class="note-pill">Herb</div>
              <div class="note-pill">Resin</div>
              <div class="note-pill">Wood</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="hero-card">
            <strong style="display:block;margin-bottom:8px">Quick details</strong>
            <div style="color:var(--muted);font-size:14px">Sessions are offered in focused intensives — 90–150 minutes. Prior to any blending we review safety and sensitivities. Our practices are safety-first and do not replace medical advice.</div>
            <div style="margin-top:12px;display:flex;gap:8px">
              <a href="book.html" class="cta" style="display:inline-block">Arrange an intensive</a>
              <a href="services.html" style="padding:12px;border-radius:10px;background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03);color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none">See offerings</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </aside>
      </section>

      <section style="padding:22px 0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px">
        <h2 style="margin:0">Proof & trust</h2>
        <div class="gallery">
          <div class="testimonials">
            <div id="quote" class="quote">""</div>
            <div class="meta">
              <div id="author" style="color:var(--muted)"></div>
              <div class="badges">
                <div class="badge">Practitioner Guild<div class="tooltip">Member, accredited continuing education</div></div>
                <div class="badge">Local Coop<div class="tooltip">Supplying independent apothecaries in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div></div>
                <div class="badge">Clean Lab<div class="tooltip">All blends prepared in our ventilated, clean facility</div></div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <aside style="width:260px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),transparent);padding:16px;border-radius:12px">
            <strong style="display:block;margin-bottom:8px">What to expect</strong>
            <ul style="color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 12px 18px">
              <li>Pre-session intake and scent history</li>
              <li>Guided smelling and notes sampling</li>
              <li>One custom blend and safety instructions</li>
            </ul>
            <a class="cta" href="book.html">Book an intensive</a>
          </aside>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section style="padding:12px 0">
        <h2>Questions and common hesitations</h2>
        <div class="faq">
          <details>
            <summary>Is aromatherapy safe during pregnancy?</summary>
            <div style="color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px">We avoid suggestive language. Many essential oils are contraindicated in pregnancy. If you are pregnant or nursing, please note this in your intake and we will adapt sessions to use pregnancy-safe options or postpone blending. Always check with your healthcare provider.</div>
          </details>

          <details>
            <summary>Can pets be affected?</summary>
            <div style="color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px">Yes. Some oils may irritate or impact animals. We provide pet-safe recommendations and dilution guidance and will advise when to avoid certain botanicals around sensitive species.</div>
          </details>

          <details>
            <summary>Do I need a patch test?</summary>
            <div style="color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px">Yes—before using a new topical blend, perform a patch test. We always provide dilution instructions and recommend testing 24 hours prior to regular use.</div>
          </details>

          <details>
            <summary>Are these sessions medical care?</summary>
            <div style="color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px">No. Our sessions are sensory and supportive in nature; language will emphasize may-support outcomes, and we do not diagnose or treat medical conditions.</div>
          </details>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section style="padding:18px 0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px">
        <div>
          <h3 style="margin:0">Ready to request a focused session?</h3>
          <p style="color:var(--muted);margin:8px 0 0">Tell us a bit and we'll reply with availability and next steps within two business days.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <a class="cta" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
      <div>Serving {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} • <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}" style="color:inherit;text-decoration:underline">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
      <div style="color:var(--muted)">© <span id="year"></span> • All rights reserved</div>
    </footer>
  </div>

  <script>
    // year
    document.getElementById('year').textContent = new Date().getFullYear();

    // Aroma wheel interaction
    (function(){
      var wheel = document.getElementById('aromaWheel');
      var desc = document.getElementById('noteDesc');
      if(!wheel) return;
      var slices = wheel.querySelectorAll('path[data-desc]');
      slices.forEach(function(s){
        s.addEventListener('mouseenter',function(){
          var t = s.getAttribute('data-type');
          var d = s.getAttribute('data-desc');
          desc.textContent = t + ' — ' + d;
          s.setAttribute('opacity','1');
          s.style.filter = 'drop-shadow(0 8px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.5))';
        });
        s.addEventListener('mouseleave',function(){
          desc.textContent = 'Hover a slice to read about that group of notes.';
          s.setAttribute('opacity',s.getAttribute('data-type')==='Top' ? '0.95' : s.getAttribute('data-type')==='Middle' ? '0.92' : '0.9');
          s.style.filter = '';
        });
        s.addEventListener('click',function(){
          // on click show example subnotes
          var type = s.getAttribute('data-type');
          var extras = {
            'Top':'Example top notes: lemon, bergamot, grapefruit.',
            'Middle':'Example middle notes: lavender, geranium, rosemary.',
            'Base':'Example base notes: cedarwood, labdanum, vetiver.'
          };
          desc.textContent = type + ' — ' + extras[type];
        });
      });
    })();

    // Proof gallery rotate
    (function(){
      var quotes = [
        {text:'A focused, careful experience — I left with a blend that still feels like presence.',author:'— S. R.'},
        {text:'Clear guidance on safety and a calm space to try things without rush.',author:'— M. K.'},
        {text:'The intensive landed exactly where I needed: practical scent tools and a small personal ritual.',author:'— A. G.'}
      ];
      var idx = 0;
      var qEl = document.getElementById('quote');
      var aEl = document.getElementById('author');
      function show(i){
        qEl.style.opacity = 0; aEl.style.opacity = 0;
        setTimeout(function(){
          qEl.textContent = '"' + quotes[i].text + '"';
          aEl.textContent = quotes[i].author;
          qEl.style.opacity = 1; aEl.style.opacity = 1;
        },300);
      }
      show(0);
      setInterval(function(){ idx = (idx+1)%quotes.length; show(idx); },5000);
    })();

    // simple form handler (no external requests)
    function handleSubmit(e){
      e.preventDefault();
      var f = e.target;
      var name = f.name.value || 'Guest';
      alert('Thanks, ' + name + '. We received your request and will be in touch at ' + (f.email.value || 'your email') + '.');
      f.reset();
      return false;
    }
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"Contact page for the aromatherapy clinic template (layoutFamily: clinic_modern).

Files included in this bundle:
- contact.html : the interactive Connect page. Contains:
  - Header / local navigation using site links.
  - Contact form (no external submission; simple JS alert acknowledges sends).
  - Interactive Aroma Wheel (Top / Middle / Base) with hover and click descriptions.
  - Proof gallery: rotating testimonials and credibility badges with tooltips.
  - FAQ section covering dilution, patch testing, pets, and pregnancy safety notes.
  - CTA buttons use placeholders: {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}} and {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}.

Placeholders to replace in your environment:
- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}, {{PHONE}}, {{EMAIL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}, {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}

Accessibility & behavior notes:
- The aroma wheel is SVG-based; hover and click update the descriptive paragraph.
- Testimonials rotate automatically; timing set to 5 seconds.
- Badges reveal short tooltips on hover; useful for showing affiliations without external assets.

Integration:
- Drop contact.html into your site root alongside other pages (index.html, services.html, etc.).
- No external fonts, images, or CDNs are used. The page references assets/img/pattern.svg optionally; add your own SVG pattern there if desired.

Safety / copy guidance:
- Copy uses safety-forward phrasing and avoids medical claims.
- FAQ includes guidance for dilution, patch testing, pets, and pregnancy; update as needed for local regulations.

Customization tips:
- Replace placeholder strings with real values.
- Modify testimonials in the inline script block to match your social proof.
- To integrate form with a backend, replace handleSubmit with a fetch() that posts to your endpoint.

